  "title": "[Radio’ Clock] Tea Time Monday with ZUNY (주니)",
  "description": "광주 손맛으로 반찬 가게를 연 주니가 의리 하나로 오픈 시간까지 미루고 나와줬는데요!\n\n많은 사람들의 반찬들을 책임지고 있다는 주니의 사장님으로써의 일상들을 들어봤습니다\n다음엔 더욱 성공한 사장님으로 다시 만나요..!!🤑\n\nJuni, who opened a side dish restaurant in Gwangju, postponed the opening time out of loyalty and showed up!\n\nWe heard about Juni's daily life as the owner, who is responsible for preparing side dishes for many people.\nNext time, let’s meet again as a more successful boss..!!🤑\n------------------------------------------------------------\nThe first English broadcasting radio station in Korea, ARIRANG RADIO.\nWe broadcast a variety of Korean culture including K-Pop music as well as news and useful information 24 hours a day.\n#반찬가게 #레이디스코드 #주니 #반찬가게사장님",
